<title>UK: Shell UK clocked with Brent date, two kept - trade.</title>
<headline>Shell UK clocked with Brent date, two kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two of the three Brent cargoes nominated loading dates on Wednesday were voluntarily kept, while the third was left with Shell UK at the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>BP and JP Morgan each kept a cargo loading Nov 21-23.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
